Wait, no!

263
00:17:59,980 --> 00:18:02,360
I said stop, not go faster!

264
00:18:10,960 --> 00:18:12,340
Oh, gum!

265
00:18:15,060 --> 00:18:15,890
Lightning!

266
00:18:23,100 --> 00:18:25,517
Grabbing lightning
straight from the clouds.

267
00:18:25,600 --> 00:18:27,012
You think you're clever?

268
00:18:42,380 --> 00:18:45,080
Oh, what an absurd power.

269
00:18:46,020 --> 00:18:47,220
Boing, boing.

270
00:18:54,000 --> 00:18:56,597
You bastard!

271
00:18:56,680 --> 00:18:58,180
Ha-ha-ha!

272
00:18:58,460 --> 00:18:59,460
Woo-hoo-hoo!

273
00:19:28,340 --> 00:19:30,000
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

274
00:19:30,180 --> 00:19:32,420
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!

275
00:19:58,400 --> 00:19:59,540
Here we go!

276
00:20:17,680 --> 00:20:19,560
Has this become a game to you?

277
00:20:19,980 --> 00:20:21,745
Then play around all you like.

278
00:20:22,620 --> 00:20:23,660
But remember...

279
00:20:31,480 --> 00:20:34,560
It'll take more than a
Devil Fruit to win this war.

280
00:20:49,720 --> 00:20:51,937
Wadju showed us the
truth with his strength.

281
00:20:52,020 --> 00:20:55,817
He became king without a Devil Fruit

282
00:20:55,900 --> 00:20:59,280
power to rely on because in the end

283
00:21:01,080 --> 00:21:03,100
Haki trumps all else

284
00:21:07,920 --> 00:21:09,260
destroyer of death

285
00:21:10,920 --> 00:21:11,750
thunder

286
00:21:13,000 --> 00:21:13,830
fadwa

287
00:21:45,960 --> 00:21:49,797
To the ones we've lost, set sail!

288
00:21:49,880 --> 00:21:52,220
Let your sky boat fly!

289
00:21:56,900 --> 00:21:58,900
The festival's almost over.

290
00:21:59,260 --> 00:22:02,400
It's funny, I'd almost
forgotten that I'm a slave.

291
00:22:06,180 --> 00:22:10,220
I hope I can survive another
year to see this again.

292
00:22:18,740 --> 00:22:20,520
Ready, Daddy?

293
00:22:21,140 --> 00:22:23,680
Find my daddy up there!

294
00:22:37,200 --> 00:22:38,640
What the hell?

295
00:22:42,020 --> 00:22:44,340
Get your grubby hand off me!

296
00:22:45,620 --> 00:22:47,237
That's supposed to be a joke!

297
00:22:47,320 --> 00:22:49,555
You're making yourself an easy target!

298
00:22:51,720 --> 00:22:53,080
Dragon twister!

299
00:22:54,300 --> 00:22:55,480
Demolition bird!

300
00:22:57,560 --> 00:22:59,557
I assume you're still vulnerable!

301
00:22:59,640 --> 00:23:01,860
To cutting attacks in your new form!

302
00:23:06,680 --> 00:23:08,377
Come on Straw Hat!

303
00:23:08,460 --> 00:23:10,440
Get your ass down here!

304
00:23:35,840 --> 00:23:36,670
Wait!

305
00:23:36,800 --> 00:23:38,080
The nail came free!

306
00:23:38,460 --> 00:23:42,120
That last tremor has released
me from this hellish prison!

307
00:23:52,360 --> 00:23:57,400
If I can't escape, I'll at
least take you down with me!

308
00:23:57,980 --> 00:24:00,480
Are you watching, Odin?

309
00:24:03,060 --> 00:24:05,360
Your daughter is at my mercy!

310
00:24:08,460 --> 00:24:10,620
WE'RE GOING TO HELL TOGETHER!

311
00:24:16,220 --> 00:24:17,680
Are you okay, boss?

312
00:24:18,100 --> 00:24:21,218
From the looks of things,
Onigashima's about to fall.

313
00:24:22,260 --> 00:24:25,200
Then Kaido's starting
to lose. That's good.

314
00:24:26,160 --> 00:24:27,940
Well, we have two options.

315
00:24:28,240 --> 00:24:30,137
I'll let you decide. If Mr.

316
00:24:30,220 --> 00:24:33,820
Straw Hat beats Kaido, the
island falls down and we all die.

317
00:24:37,160 --> 00:24:42,920
Option two we make it out alive
because Kaido survives the battle.

318
00:24:44,840 --> 00:24:45,670
You kidding?

319
00:24:45,753 --> 00:24:47,177
Well that's easy enough.

320
00:24:47,260 --> 00:24:50,017
I have a kid back in Hakumai
that I'm fighting for.

321
00:24:50,100 --> 00:24:52,437
And I'm fighting for
my wife back in Ringo.

322
00:24:52,520 --> 00:24:56,337
If Kaido gets his ass kicked, our
families can live happily ever after.

323
00:24:56,420 --> 00:24:58,077
It'll be a great country.

324
00:24:58,160 --> 00:25:00,637
Everyone down there will
have a bright future?

325
00:25:00,720 --> 00:25:03,560
Are you samurai out of your damn minds?

326
00:25:03,840 --> 00:25:06,077
You won't be alive to enjoy it, you know?

327
00:25:06,160 --> 00:25:08,120
And that's fine by us.

328
00:25:09,760 --> 00:25:11,160
Make Kaido pay!

329
00:25:11,820 --> 00:25:13,660
Don't hold back, Straw Hat!

330
00:25:13,880 --> 00:25:15,840
We came here to win this fight!

331
00:25:21,280 --> 00:25:22,860
We won't back down!

332
00:25:31,040 --> 00:25:32,360
I don't want to die!

333
00:25:35,080 --> 00:25:37,600
I refuse to die!

334
00:25:41,020 --> 00:25:43,360
No fire to get the best of me!

335
00:25:44,380 --> 00:25:45,760
Encore! Encore!

336
00:25:52,940 --> 00:25:53,770
Water!

337
00:25:57,160 --> 00:25:58,680
Kiku! Kill him on!

338
00:25:58,900 --> 00:26:00,117
We can't give up!

339
00:26:00,200 --> 00:26:01,760
No matter what!

340
00:26:14,200 --> 00:26:16,140
Stop! Onigashima!

341
00:26:17,600 --> 00:26:18,430
Hey!

342
00:26:18,513 --> 00:26:19,343
Dome!

343
00:26:28,700 --> 00:26:35,440
I'm about to wrap this fight up, but you've
got to move that island out of the way!

344
00:26:40,980 --> 00:26:42,620
This fist is huge.

345
00:26:43,160 --> 00:26:46,317
He could punch a hole straight
through Onigashima with that thing.

346
00:26:46,400 --> 00:26:47,230
Stop!

347
00:26:47,313 --> 00:26:48,143
Wait, Luffy!

348
00:26:48,226 --> 00:26:50,220
I'm not ready yet! Mama!

349
00:26:55,260 --> 00:26:56,820
You got this!

350
00:26:57,200 --> 00:26:58,880
I trust you!
